# Paths renv::dependencies() should skip when building renv.lock.
#
# The lockfile describes what the DEPLOYED SERVICE needs: app.R, agent/api.R,
# their source chains, and the daily preprint refresh in /etc/cron.d/abstractinator.
# archive/ holds retired generations kept for reference, and including them pulled ~8 packages the service never loads into the lockfile --
# one of which (igraph, via tidygraph) needs a system library that broke the
# weekly restore check on a clean runner.
#
# Verified unused 2026-10-26: no shell history invocations, no logged searches
# from a CLI channel, and the `abstractinator` alias points at the v6 tree, not
# at this copy. Still in git history if any of it is ever wanted back.

archive/
